 the seat allows (often age 3–4). In a crash, the shell absorbs force instead of a child’s neck."}]]}],["$","h2","h2-10",{"id":"2-tight-installation-safe-installation","className":"text-3xl text-tmCharcoal","children":"2. Tight Installation = Safe Installation"}],["$","p","p-12",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-tmCharcoal/85","children":[["$","span","text-Your seat should move less than one inch at the belt path. If it wiggles, reinstall. Watch manufacturer videos and keep the manual handy.-0",{"children":"Your seat should move less than one inch at the belt path. If it wiggles, reinstall. Watch manufacturer videos and keep the manual handy."}]]}],["$","h2","h2-14",{"id":"3-harness-must-pass-the-pinch-test","className":"text-3xl text-tmCharcoal","children":"3. Harness Must Pass the Pinch Test"}],["$","p","p-16",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-tmCharcoal/85","children":[["$","span","text-If you can pinch the webbing at the shoulder, it’s too loose. Pull the tail strap until the harness hugs the chest snugly.-0",{"children":"If you can pinch the webbing at the shoulder, it’s too loose. Pull the tail strap until the harness hugs the chest snugly."}]]}],["$","h2","h2-18",{"id":"4-no-puffy-coats-in-car-seats","className":"text-3xl text-tmCharcoal","children":"4. No Puffy Coats in Car Seats"}],["$","p","p-20",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-tmCharcoal/85","children":[["$","span","text-Compressible layers create slack during impact.-0",{"children":"Compressible layers create slack during impact."}]]}],["$","p","p-22",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-tmCharcoal/85","children":[["$","strong","strong-Instead:-1",{"className":"font-semibold text-tmCharcoal","children":"Instead:"}]]}],["$","ul","list-12",{"className":"ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-tmCharcoal/80","children":[["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","span","text-Warm the car first-0",{"children":"Warm the car first"}]]}],["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","span","text-Use a car-seat-safe coat or poncho-0",{"children":"Use a car-seat-safe coat or poncho"}]]}],["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","span","text-Place a blanket over the harness-0",{"children":"Place a blanket over the harness"}]]}]]}],["$","h2","h2-27",{"id":"5-don-t-rush-the-next-stage","className":"text-3xl text-tmCharcoal","children":"5. Don’t Rush the Next Stage"}],["$","ul","list-14",{"className":"ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-tmCharcoal/80","children":[["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","span","text-Rear-facing → stay as long as possible-0",{"children":"Rear-facing → stay as long as possible"}]]}],["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","span","text-Forward-facing → minimum age 5-0",{"children":"Forward-facing → minimum age 5"}]]}],["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","span","text-Booster → until the seatbelt fits (usually 9–12)-0",{"children":"Booster → until the seatbelt fits (usually 9–12)"}]]}],["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","span","text-Seatbelt only when knees bend naturally at the edge of the seat-0",{"children":"Seatbelt only when knees bend naturally at the edge of the seat"}]]}]]}],["$","h2","h2-34",{"id":"6-travel-like-a-pro","className":"text-3xl text-tmCharcoal","children":"6. Travel Like a Pro"}],["$","ul","list-16",{"className":"ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-tmCharcoal/80","children":[["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-Nuna PIPA RX + RELX base-1",{"className":"font-semibold text-tmCharcoal","children":"Nuna PIPA RX + RELX base"}],["$","span","text- for seamless daily installs-2",{"children":" for seamless daily installs"}]]}],["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-Nuna PIPA Lite-1",{"className":"font-semibold text-tmCharcoal","children":"Nuna PIPA Lite"}],["$","span","text- for belt-path travel-2",{"children":" for belt-path travel"}]]}],["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-WAYB Pico-1",{"className":"font-semibold text-tmCharcoal","children":"WAYB Pico"}],["$","span","text- for toddler jet-setters-2",{"childr